WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,380
Xiaoyue, this is the milk powder I bought for Sanya.

2
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,820
I asked the after-sales person at the supply and marketing cooperative

3
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,340
People say this bowl needs to be soaked in warm water

4
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,940
Okay, it just so happens that the three ducks are still hungry at the moment.

5
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,500
I'm going to make a bowl and give it a try

6
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,460
Mom, since you said my good luck is the smoke coming out of the ancestral graves,

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,740
These roasted chickens and braised pork heads will be taken to the grave.

8
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,220
Let’s work hard for our ancestors too

9
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,780
Let them continue to bless you and make you rich

10
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:46,280
Secretary, I'm coming today

11
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:47,800
I want to ask about the loan in Wuxi

12
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,480
What are you kid doing asking about that thing?

13
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:50,880
You don’t want a loan, do you?

14
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,960
Yes, I plan to take out a loan to buy a big boat.

15
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,240
No, you kid is crazy

16
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,840
What would a rural person do if he fell over that?

17
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,200
Those credit union loan officers

18
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:58,400
Traveling to various towns every day

19
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,760
My calves were running around in the stream a few times

20
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:00,800
I can't find anyone to get a loan either.

21
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,920
Baby, think about it

22
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,600
If this thing is really profitable

23
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:04,720
As for those people rushing up

24
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,880
Are you chasing us fishermen? Three scholarly scholars?

25
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,320
You are also worried about something happening to me. Please remember this.

26
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,960
But the state provides loans to Wuxi

27
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,440
Just to make everyone work hard and get rich

28
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:15,160
As the saying goes, the brave will be starved to death and the timid will starve to death.

29
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,880
Others are afraid, but I, Zhang Jianguo, am not afraid.

30
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:23,790
This is the loan policy given by the credit union

31
00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:27,070
What procedures do you need to prepare? It’s all written above and this one.

32
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:28,470
This is a letter of introduction to our village

33
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:30,230
If you want a loan, this is a must-have

34
00:01:31,750 --> 00:01:33,150
My child, you have to think about it.

35
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:34,670
Once this loan is taken out

36
00:01:34,790 --> 00:01:35,870
That's a big mountain

37
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:37,430
No matter whether you can make money in the future or not

38
00:01:37,550 --> 00:01:38,750
This money must be paid back

39
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:40,470
Uncle Huang, don’t worry, I understand.
